<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-bottom:12.0pt">Hi Sandra,<br>
<br>
Firstly sorry for the late reply - I have just come out of an insanely bus=
y period at work (working way too late, too many nights!).&nbsp; Hopefully=
 it will abate for a week or so now, then busy again for another week.
<br>
<br>
And thank you so much for your lovely compliments about our family.&nbsp; =
You have such an encouraging, loving way Sandra - indeed as you always hav=
e and as such are a wonderful ambassador for our Lord Jesus.&nbsp; And it =
was great to see you at Hillsong also - a God-incidence
 I would say.<br>
<br>
And more thanks - for remembering our ministry at NSCC.&nbsp; What an hono=
r to serve His Kingdom at that time.&nbsp; I would do the same again today=
=2E&nbsp; Yes I would be happy to put together a 250 to 300 word &quot;blo=
g&quot; for you. We as a family can also get to one of the celebration
 services (6pm 18th or 11am 19th).&nbsp; Incidentally I may have some supp=
orting pictures / video - no promises, but if I can locate that in my stuf=
f is that useable?<br>
<br>
I will get back to you soon with my &quot;blog&quot; <span class=3D"moz-sm=
iley-s1">:-) </span>
<br>
<br>
Blessings,<br>
<br>
Chris<o:p></o:p></p>
