ou..<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">NSCC is celebrating 30 years this year &#8211; Ps S=
ean &amp; Lynda plus Deborah and Mark are coming to help us celebrate on t=
he weekend of 18/19 April (6pm on 18<sup>th</sup> and 9am and 11 services =
on the Sunday).. We are putting together a &#8220;timeline&#8221;
 from go to now which will include &#8220;blogs&#8221; from lots of people=
 involved in NSCC during these 30 years.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Chris, you were integral to starting up LifeSource =
and so much a part of making that the success that it currently is.&nbsp; =
&nbsp; We&#8217;d love you to write a story about that to share with the c=
hurch family.&nbsp; I don&#8217;t know the ins and outs of how this
 happened but I&#8217;m sure there is plenty of material for a story of ab=
out 250 to 300 words.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Would you like to do that and if so, could you do t=
hat by 10<sup>th</sup> March?<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Look forward to hearing from you.<o:p></o:p></p>
