Firstly sorry for the late reply - I have just come out of an insanely bus=
y period at work (working way too late, too many nights!).=C2=A0 Hopefully=
 it will abate for a week or so now, then busy again for another week. 

And thank you so much for your lovely compliments about our family.=C2=A0 =
You have such an encouraging, loving way Sandra - indeed as you always hav=
e and as such are a wonderful ambassador for our Lord Jesus.=C2=A0 And it =
was great to see you at Hillsong also - a God-incidence I would say.

And more thanks - for remembering our ministry at NSCC.=C2=A0 What an hono=
r to serve His Kingdom at that time.=C2=A0 I would do the same again today=
=2E=C2=A0 Yes I would be happy to put together a 250 to 300 word "blog" fo=
r you. We as a family can also get to one of the celebration services (6pm=
 18th or 11am 19th).=C2=A0 Incidentally I may have some supporting picture=
s / video - no promises, but if I can locate that in my stuff is that usea=
ble?

I will get back to you soon with my "blog" :-) 

Blessings,

Chris

C&S Welch 28 Leuna Ave WAHROONGA NSW 2076 (02) 9487 3803 

