rah and Mark are coming to help us celebrate on the weekend of 18/19 April=
 (6pm on 18th and 9am and 11 services on the Sunday).. We are putting toge=
ther a =E2=80=9Ctimeline=E2=80=9D from go to now which will include =E2=80=
=9Cblogs=E2=80=9D from lots of people involved in NSCC during these 30 yea=
rs.

=C2=A0

Chris, you were integral to starting up LifeSource and so much a part of m=
aking that the success that it currently is.=C2=A0 =C2=A0 We=E2=80=99d lov=
e you to write a story about that to share with the church family.=C2=A0 I=
 don=E2=80=99t know the ins and outs of how this happened but I=E2=80=99m =
